{"id":11466522121,"name":"Easy Obby but you get banned if you die!","desc":"🎮 Easy Obby but you get BANNED if you DIE! 😱\n\nWelcome to the easiest obby you’ll ever play... or so you think 👀\n\n😈 One mistake and you're OUT – die once, and you're BANNED for 20 seconds!\n💀 Fall off? Miss a jump? Say goodbye… (temporarily).\n💾 Your stage is automatically saved, even if you leave or get banned!\n\nBut don’t worry — skilled players get rewarded!\n✨ Complete stages to earn COINS!\n💰 Use your coins to REDUCE your ban time... or stack them up for bragging rights.\n🔥 Come back after your ban and get a special bonus reward — loyalty pays off!\n\n🎯 Can you beat the obby without a single fail?\n🏆 Challenge your friends and prove who’s the REAL obby master.\n\n💡 It's simple. It's fun. It's brutal. Are you in?\n\n🔮 Premium players get a chat tag, more coming soon! 🔮","path":"/game/11466522121-easy-obby-but-you-get-banned-if-you-die","slug":"11466522121-easy-obby-but-you-get-banned-if-you-die","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/5d8be297b68ef4339577cd1d0308cbba8b167485429ca57f2df342b0b49875f4.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-88f0afcb25c9e47368b843f2aa74ac2d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":18366077,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-22T07:55:11.594Z","creator":{"name":"Lots Of Obbys","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Easy-Obby-but-you-get-banned-if-you-die!-delete-all-killbricks-49629","_id":"68a8225f202bfdc83050eefe","title":"delete all killbricks","game":{"_id":"68a8225f202bfdc83050eefb","gameId":11466522121,"name":"Easy Obby but you get banned if you die!","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":11466522121},"features":"Deletes all killbricks so you will never banned again. Made by chatgpt","tags":["obby","Obby","killbricks","idontknowwhatineedtotypeinthis","xd"],"script":"local killFolder = workspace:FindFirstChild(\"KillObjects\")\nif not killFolder then\n    warn(\"Папка KillObjects не найдена в workspace.\")\n    return\nend\n\nfor _, part in ipairs(killFolder:GetChildren()) do\n    if part:IsA(\"BasePart\") then\n        -- Проверяем наличие объекта TouchInterest среди дочерних элементов\n        local hasTouchInterest = false\n        for _, child in ipairs(part:GetChildren()) do\n            if child.Name == \"TouchInterest\" then\n                hasTouchInterest = true\n                break\n            end\n        end\n\n        -- Если есть TouchInterest, удаляем часть\n        if hasTouchInterest then\n            part:Destroy()\n        end\n    end\nend","owner":{"_id":"66acd6feee0491e4f2a69750","username":"glebbuba686","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"66acd6feee0491e4f2a69750","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"verified":false,"views":1823,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/49fb51c7476b50d7114561845b0768e3596aa1bf1fd9c90e482509faa14c0d0f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/11466522121-1755849311573.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/11466522121-1755849311573.png"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-08-22T07:55:11.595Z","executes":17,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-14T03:12:15.699Z"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/49fb51c7476b50d7114561845b0768e3596aa1bf1fd9c90e482509faa14c0d0f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/11466522121-17